{"version":1,"content":"<p>小鵬集團MONA產品經理恩塔近日在社交平台發佈視頻，為此前MONA L05預售發佈會上的「老登」相關言論致歉。10月15日，小鵬舉行MONA L05預售發佈會。在發佈會上，00後產品經理恩塔多次使用「老登」稱呼，相關表述引發爭議。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583502.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.954684+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"e07be8f88d7f9de5cd8c0b329a6a5752e41f6c7d28065b7aa5d3f50626bee549","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}